# Feed the Swarm: "Destroy target creature or enchantment an opponent controls. You lose life equal to that permanent's
# mana value." Bot2 regenerates its Springheart Nantuko (mana value 2) in response (CR 701.19a): the target is still legal,
# so the spell resolves and Bot1 loses 2 life even though nothing was destroyed (the official ruling). The Nantuko stays,
# tapped by the regeneration.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Feed the Swarm
Swamp x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Yavimaya Hollow
Mox Emerald
Mox Emerald
Mox Emerald
Springheart Nantuko
Forest x15

